### Why it is vendored

The package needed a pre-flight validator that catches data-quality
defects in its own generated reports — wrong price scale, wrong
weekday, allocation totals that do not sum, mixed notation, mixed
units. This skill implements exactly those checks in the Python
standard library, with no dependencies and no network access.

